                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Has-Been Heroes is an enjoyable and challenging game with a unique combat system that makes it stand out from other roguelike games. It takes some time to get used to the mechanics, but once everything starts to click, the combat becomes quite satisfying. There is a good amount of strategy involved, and experimenting with different spells and character combinations keeps things interesting. The game can be pretty difficult at times, and some runs can feel a bit frustrating, but that is also part of what makes it rewarding when things finally work out. Overall, it's a fun game with an interesting concept that is worth trying if you enjoy strategy and roguelike elements.",
